offset 分页的代价（等价写法）：
```sql
-- 深翻：先扫描并丢弃前 100000 行
SELECT * FROM t_coupon_task_fail
WHERE batch_id = #{batchId}
ORDER BY id
LIMIT 100000, 20;
```
书签分页：
```sql
SELECT * FROM t_coupon_task_fail
WHERE batch_id = #{batchId}
  AND id > #{lastId}
ORDER BY id
LIMIT #{pageSize};
```
